.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/bin
**/target
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage*
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.local
*.log
*.pem
*.key
